            <span class="thermal-lambda-unit">nm</span>
          </div>
          <div class="thermal-spectrum-wrap" id="thermal-spectrum-wrap" style="display:none">
            <div class="thermal-spectrum-header">
              <span class="thermal-spectrum-title">Absorption cross-section &sigma;<sub>abs</sub>(&lambda;)</span>
              <div class="thermal-lambda-control">
                <label for="thermal-lambda-slider">Illumination &lambda;</label>
                <input type="range" class="param-slider" id="thermal-lambda-slider" min="300" max="1200" step="5" value="550">
                <input type="number" class="param-number param-number--sm" id="thermal-lambda-num" value="550" step="5" min="100">
                <span class="thermal-lambda-unit">nm</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <canvas id="thermal-spectrum-canvas" aria-label="Absorption cross-section spectrum"></canvas>
            <div class="thermal-range-control">
              <label>&lambda; range</label>
              <input type="number" class="param-number param-number--sm" id="thermal-range-min" value="300" step="10" min="100">
              <span class="thermal-lambda-unit">&ndash;</span>
              <input type="number" class="param-number param-number--sm" id="thermal-range-max" value="1200" step="10" min="100">
              <span class="thermal-lambda-unit">nm</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="color-swatches" id="color-swatches">
            <span class="swatch-label">Apparent color</span>
            <div class="swatch-item">
              <div class="swatch-box" id="swatch-sca"></div>
              <span class="swatch-name">scattered</span>
            </div>
            <div class="swatch-item">
              <div class="swatch-box" id="swatch-trans"></div>
              <span class="swatch-name">transmitted</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="download-bar">
            <span class="download-label">Export</span>
            <button id="dl-png" class="dl-btn" title="Download chart as PNG image" data-umami-event="mie-export" data-umami-event-format="png">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"/><path d="m21 15-5-5L5 21"/></svg>
              PNG
            </button>
            <button id="dl-csv" class="dl-btn" title="Download all data as CSV" data-umami-event="mie-export" data-umami-event-format="csv">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg>
              CSV
            </button>
            <button id="dl-share" class="dl-btn" title="Copy shareable link to clipboard" data-umami-event="share" data-umami-event-page="mie">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"/><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"/></svg>
              Share
            </button>
          </div>
          </div>

          <div class="notes-card card" id="notes-card">
            <h4>Notes</h4>
            <div id="notes-body"></div>
            <PresetStrip presets={miePresets} showCopy={false} />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="references card">
        <h4>References</h4>
        <ul class="reference-list">
          <li><span class="ref-index">[1]</span><span>C. F. Bohren &amp; D. R. Huffman, <em>Absorption and Scattering of Light by Small Particles</em> (Wiley, 1983).</span></li>
          <li><span class="ref-index">[2]</span><span>F. J. Garc&iacute;a de Abajo, <em>Relativistic energy loss and induced photon emission in the interaction of a dielectric sphere with an external electron beam</em>, Phys. Rev. B <strong>59</strong>, 3095 (1999), <a href="https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevB.59.3095" target="_blank" rel="noopener">doi:10.1103/PhysRevB.59.3095</a>.</span></li>
          <li><span class="ref-index">[3]</span><span>P. E. Stamatopoulou, W. Zhao, A. Rodr&iacute;guez Echarri, N. A. Mortensen, K. Busch, C. Tserkezis &amp; C. Wolff, <em>Electron beams traversing spherical nanoparticles: analytic and numerical treatment</em>, Phys. Rev. Research <strong>6</strong>, 013239 (2024), <a href="https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevResearch.6.013239" target="_blank" rel="noopener">doi:10.1103/PhysRevResearch.6.013239</a>.</span></li>
          <li><span class="ref-index">[4]</span><span>Optical constants: <a href="https://refractiveindex.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener">refractiveindex.info</a>. Au, Ag: Johnson &amp; Christy (1972); Si: Aspnes &amp; Studna (1983); Al: Raki&cacute; (1995); TiO<sub>2</sub>: Sarkar et al. (2019).</span></li>
          <li><span class="ref-index">[5]</span><span>L. Meng, R. Yu, M. Qiu &amp; F. J. Garc&iacute;a de Abajo, <em>Plasmonic nano-oven by concatenation of multishell photothermal enhancement</em> (Thermal view), ACS Nano <strong>11</strong>, 7915&ndash;7924 (2017), <a href="https://doi.org/10.1021/acsnano.7b02426" target="_blank" rel="noopener">doi:10.1021/acsnano.7b02426</a>.</span></li>
          <li><span class="ref-index">[6]</span><span>Y. S. Kim, P. T. Leung &amp; T. F. George, <em>Classical decay rates for molecules in the presence of a spherical surface: A complete treatment</em>, Surf. Sci. <strong>195</strong>, 1 (1988), <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/0039-6028(88)90776-5" target="_blank" rel="noopener">doi:10.1016/0039-6028(88)90776-5</a>.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <dialog class="structure-dialog" id="structure-dialog" aria-labelledby="structure-dialog-title">
        <div class="structure-dialog__panel">
          <div class="structure-dialog__header">
            <h3 id="structure-dialog-title">Structure Drawing</h3>
            <div class="structure-dialog__actions">
              <button type="button" class="chart-tool-btn" id="structure-export-png" title="Download structure drawing as PNG">Export PNG</button>
              <button type="button" class="chart-tool-btn" id="structure-export-csv" title="Download structure geometry as CSV">Export CSV</button>
              <button type="button" class="structure-dialog__close" id="structure-dialog-close" aria-label="Close structure drawing">&times;</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="structure-dialog__art" id="structure-dialog-art"></div>
        </div>
